&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;When travelers are searching for a hotel, we want the obvious choice to be trivago! By comparing prices from major booking sites, we&#39;re making it easy for people to find hotels they want at a price they&#39;ll love. In the lively city of Düsseldorf, we seize opportunities to learn every day, innovate, and make an enduring mark on the travel industry. A career at trivago is a journey designed for people who crave continuous development and want to thrive in a high-performing team. Here you will find those who aren&#39;t afraid of change but rather embrace it, turning every challenge into a pathway for growth. Join trivago, work with a great team, and grow with us!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Join us in making a difference&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our Visual and AI Content team brings trivago&#39;s platform to life through images and AI-generated content — from the main image and photo galleries to destination visuals, hotel highlights, and review summaries — delivered straight to travelers as they search. As a Working Student in Data &amp;amp; Insights, you&#39;ll sit between data science, product, and content operations, helping our small team ship features seen by millions. You&#39;ll work closely with scientists to dig into data, partner with our product manager on analysis that shapes decisions, and coordinate with external annotators to keep our quality bar high. It&#39;s a hands-on look at how a modern AI content pipeline runs end to end, with plenty of room to learn and grow as you build real data analytics and product skills — including the chance to pick up Python and SQL along the way. trivago is a place where ambition and support go hand in hand — we hold high standards and genuinely invest in each other&#39;s growth.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;How you’ll make an impact&lt;/strong&gt;:&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work closely with data scientists and the product managers on analysis work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coordinate with external data annotators to perform quality checks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support the product manager with product analysis, including competitor benchmarking and market trend tracking relevant to trivago&#39;s AI-generated content.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analyze user behavior data to surface insights that inform product and content decisions across trivago&#39;s platform.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Implement models that generate data based on defined business rules to support content and product decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help translate data insights into product requirements and prioritization recommendations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll learn&lt;/strong&gt;:&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;How a modern AI content pipeline runs end-to-end — from data collection and annotation to production deployment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;How to translate business rules into working data models that power real product decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Practical, hands-on experience with Python and SQL in a live production environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;How data-driven teams evaluate and improve visual and AI-generated content — from images and galleries to hotel highlights and review summaries — at scale.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;How to conduct product and competitor analysis, and translate data into requirements and prioritization decisions like a product manager.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll need to thrive:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An interest in product management — comfortable translating data into clear requirements and helping shape prioritization decisions, while communicating effectively across a cross-functional team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong analytical skills — hands-on experience with Python and/or SQL is a plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Currently enrolled at a German university (Immatrikulationsbescheinigung required).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A genuine learning mindset — you approach challenges with curiosity, seek out feedback, and continuously look for ways to develop and grow.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A performance mindset — you set ambitious goals for yourself and have the determination and resilience to follow through and achieve them.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An open and curious mindset toward AI tools and automation — you actively explore how AI can enhance your work and are excited to grow alongside evolving technologies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Not ticking every box? We still want to hear from you. Apply, tell us what motivates you, and you could be a great match — now or in the future. Your application does not need to include a photo.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Recruiting process for this student position:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;One-way video interview&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Introduction Call&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Technical Interview&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you can look forward to:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;As you grow, so do we. This is why at trivago, we prioritize your development, offer personalized coaching through Nilo, and provide workshops, educational meetups, conferences, free online learning courses, and access to a fully-equipped campus library.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Enjoy your office days. Use your daily canteen budget to share lunch with colleagues in our canteen, help yourself to complimentary snacks and drinks in our kitchens, choose from a variety of fitness options with our on-site gym, sports classes, and Urban Sports Club membership, and enjoy the comfort of ergonomic desks and focused work areas.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Thank you for considering a career at trivago! Our commitment to fostering an inclusive and enriching environment for all talents is at the heart of what we do. We understand that embarking on a new job opportunity is a blend of excitement and curiosity. Should any questions arise before you apply, feel free to reach out to us at &lt;/em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;mailto:joinus@trivago.com&quot;&gt;joinus@trivago.com&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;. Join us in our mission to make a positive impact on global travel, w&lt;/em&gt;&lt;em&gt;e look forward to your application!&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
